      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "this would be good for things like group houses, allowing any player that's part of a group to make a new instance of the house even if the original uploader is offline. Granted, this comes with its own complications, as it's essentially making the world public, and would have to be reviewed with the same scrutiny. \n\nShould clear a lot of the chaff out of the new worlds field, I support this.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
