      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Special private worlds cannot put as favorite. I must always wait for owner to enter world. Aside, it's also more work for owner to enable world again and again.\nMight have sensitive side, but not bad idea. For friends only is okay. But Friends+ is not good idea because it causes chain invites and will invite others the owner don't like much. Included new players and visitors.\nPure friends to owner is more logic choice due trust between friends and owner.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
