      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Since the new quick menu and main menu were implemented, this is kinda possible already.\n\nIn the new main menu you can open the world's webpage. On that webpage you can create an instance of the world, even if the world is set to private.\n\nThere are questions about rather or not other people should be allowed to make instances of someone else's private world. But there have not been any definitive answers to it yet.\n\nSee: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/access-to-private-worlds\n\nPersonally, I would love to see more levels of world privacy. The suggestion here might be a good improvement too. Maybe even better suggestions can be made with the new groups feature too.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
